\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S33}{\ignorespaces Cross-evaluator re-decoding of the noisy-gloss retrieval outputs (641 PHX-public keys; \S  \ref  {sec:competition_real}). Gap = noisy-gloss $-$ REC, corpus sacreBLEU-4 (flat-reference form, \S  \ref  {sec:method} protocol). The realistic retrieval pipeline is roughly even with REC under the released evaluator ($-0.13$), and every non-degenerate evaluator gives a negative gap; the five degenerate checkpoints (three $\alpha {=}1.0$ distillation students, two smallest ladder fractions) decode empty or near-empty hypotheses.\relax }}{33}{table.caption.113}\protected@file@percent }
